Setting Purpose <code>shared_buffers</code> Memory PostgreSQL uses for shared data caching <code>work_mem</code> Base limit for many query operations before temporary files may be used <code>maintenance_work_mem</code> Memory budget for certain maintenance operations <code>effective_cache_size</code> Planner estimate of cache available to a query; not an allocation <pre><code>SHOW shared_buffers;
SHOW work_mem;
SHOW maintenance_work_mem;
SHOW effective_cache_size;
</code></pre> <p>work_mem is not a per-server cap</p> <p>A query can use multiple memory-consuming operations, and many sessions can execute concurrently. Estimate aggregate demand before increasing <code>work_mem</code>.</p>
